00:01:42.966 --> 00:01:44.470
With God.

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:45.348
- [Interviewer] Ya,

00:01:45.348 --> 00:01:46.181
- [Speaker Chuckles]

00:01:46.181 --> 00:01:49.600
